{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》單元《危險遊戲》劇情緊湊，其中飾演狂迷（Wendy）的胡敏芝，憑著清純的校服造型以及真摯的喊戲成功引起熱話，演技備受網民大讚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在劇中，面對洪梓朗（繆家慶飾）欲清理家仁（吳偉豪飾）房間的遺物時，Wendy情緒失控、聲淚俱下維護：「佢唔係我偶像，佢係救咗我嘅英雄。」她剖白當年因發育太好遭男同學言語欺凌，而吳偉豪飾演的Jarvis拍片惡整欺凌者，間接為她出一口氣，自此成為拯救她的英雄，促使她加入網台當其身邊的「羅賓」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"883e31a6-e0bb-487a-a9c1-b21ff3080f3e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Ulk6Qd9UwF1784629628.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"883e31a6-e0bb-487a-a9c1-b21ff3080f3e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d8fb9049-cc52-4091-a8d3-c5c1cf5e731b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026gGMc07BmkJ1784629622.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d8fb9049-cc52-4091-a8d3-c5c1cf5e731b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">談到這場喊戲，</span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://胡敏芝接受tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">胡敏芝接受tvb.com</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">獨家訪問自言本身是「喊包」，又指拍攝時進入了Wendy的情緒狀態，「呢個故事人物好完整，令到所有嘢會容易啲投入，一諗起Jarvis唔喺度，Wendy已經好傷心，啲眼淚停唔到。」 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">她續說：「我唔想自己做得唔好拖累大家，所以事前熟讀劇本了解角色情感，拍嘅時候就會順暢好多。」</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T04:31:27.988064+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}